silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_06_domain_entry_points_sections_01_forge_entry_concrete_anchor_2#mittensapex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensApex is Mittens the concrete domestic cat: colim apex of D_Mittens with ten typed source legs (cat, taxonomy, evidence, quality, measurement, role, process, storage, validation, trace). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
